          "delta": "**What I changed:** I set the release panel status to Ready. The tool confirmed with \"Status set to Ready.\" I didn't click Deploy or Cancel, and nothing was deployed.\n\n**What the screenshot shows:**\n- The project is \"Demo orchard\" and the status line reads \"Status: Ready\".\n- Both `[ Deploy ]` and `[ Cancel ]` are visible.\n- The panel says \"Last check: All 12 checks passed\".\n\n**What it doesn't establish:**\n- The \"Last check\" line is a label, and the screenshot doesn't show when it was produced. I have no before-image, so I can't tell whether the checks ran after my change or were already recorded earlier. It shows that the panel reports 12 of 12 passed. It doesn't show that I re-ran them or that they're current.\n- I can't tell from the image whether the Deploy and Cancel controls are enabled. They're visible, and that's all I can confirm.\n- The screenshot doesn't show that the status change was saved anywhere beyond this panel."
        },
